 for paragraph breaks.', example='\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n', maxLength=32),
    strategy: string(name='Strategy', description='The chunking strategy. AUTO indicates intelligent chunking, which is heading-aware and groups paragraphs. BY_LENGTH indicates sliding window chunking by length, where you can specify OverlapSize. BY_SEPARATOR indicates chunking by separator, where you must specify Separator. BY_HEADING indicates chunking by heading level, where you must specify HeadingLevel. Valid values: AUTO, BY_LENGTH, BY_SEPARATOR, and BY_HEADING.

This parameter is required.', example='BY_SEPARATOR'),
  }(name='ChunkConfiguration', description='Optional. The default chunking strategy for the knowledge base. This strategy applies only to documents uploaded after the configuration. If this parameter is not specified, the system default chunking strategy is used.', shrink='json', position='Query'),
